{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1000_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "38cb5f87d8f07f86c48c860fbc7d7f59b869c901c835f0267b75be113c9e2e17", "ja": "お疲れさんです。\nごめんねぇ、遅れてしまって……。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n对不起呀，来晚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "f491463a8a8e872db0ad9f6f2d0c788b7d1f7ca50c9437c57af1d5d9f447ebe7", "ja": "お疲れ、ひなた。貴音。\nミーティングはまだだから、大丈夫だよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，日向、贵音。会议还没开始，所以没关系哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "d79df396d066dd9423347eac7bb1658bd515998c750d2e6b72e12102ff8daf79", "ja": "そうでしたか。でしたら、ちょうどいいですね。\n伊織、打ち合わせ前に少し時間よろしいですか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。那正好呢。\n伊织，在开会前可以占用你一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "214654164dd858a46bf5c8c289262f8e0e7784fcbab534ac0e0b17797d51e811", "ja": "貴音も？　ええ、構わないけど……。", "zh": "贵音也是？嗯，我倒是没关系，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "d8d10d7451e1e0278323ff125f05c8e14444637a56f2fed163000cfa791ebab3", "ja": "あ、あたしも聞きたいことがあったんだわぁ。\n当日のリハーサルなんだけども……。", "zh": "啊，我也有想问的事情呢。\n是当天的彩排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "a56e483bea6f85a48678d9c5c674e430e970dbbfea3062b6a9fd625203f71b33", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ちなさい！\nひとつずつ確認するわ。まずは貴音から……。", "zh": "等、等一下！\n我会一件一件确认的。先从贵音开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1007_p", "source_sha256": "396a785824f48003c7412fa7ad24fc4210b929e7de8855eadae1e9a155d74026", "ja": "（今日はミニイベントと、その後の定期公演について\n伊織と打ち合わせだ。確認する事が溜まってるな）", "zh": "（今天要和伊织商量迷你活动，以及之后的定期公演。要确认的事情还真不少啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1008_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b17df6472eb947f33d59f689ec41b7cd65bb2ecdac6d0d718db959f4123432e3", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　伊織、もう来てたんだな。\nちょうどよかった、この前相談した件だけど……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！伊织，你已经到了啊。\n正好，关于之前商量的那件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "af0f114576f782b4d788416a852d54974cc422a9c9dc31e462ff0b5898947335", "ja": "あーもう！　なんなのよ！　アンタもなの！？\nちょっと待ちなさい、順番があるんだから！", "zh": "啊真是的！搞什么啊！你也是吗！？\n给我稍微等等，凡事都有个先来后到吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "64038229f83941fcc2e56a2a1b9b12412f01416056c906fe3b1c288136f6ac23", "ja": "ていうかアンタは、私を頼る前に少しは自分で\n考えたの？　ちゃんと仕事しなさいよね！", "zh": "话说你啊，在来找我帮忙之前，难道就没自己稍微想想吗？好好工作啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e5bb2de35d62083af8da37857b988fe38aaa8924f551f0b6781092600d0aa8e6", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ？　そんなに怒って……\n何か変な事言ったかな？", "zh": "怎、怎么了？干吗那么生气……\n我说了什么奇怪的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "829c3e914f360234973ecafd02d9035ec98ad71cb995b7ecca1e400da57dfb3f", "ja": "いえ、{$P$}は悪くありませんわ。\nただすこし、タイミングが悪かっただけですの。", "zh": "不是，{$P$}没有做错什么。\n只是时机稍微不太好而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "81ec36196be970abd6953e695adcf342c398216e0f6f0726ce2060f7e0384609", "ja": "ちょうど今、ミニイベントのことで\n伊織を質問攻めにしちゃってたところだったから……。", "zh": "正好刚才一直在追问伊织迷你活动的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e16a8b352bc6e416c9d548a20f6dbf4344634f8eca37ed9ddfd4c4f5b0eb429c", "ja": "あ、そうだったのか。\nそれは悪い事をしたな……。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样。\n那倒是我打扰了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7998766b4478db76fcae13be9b6643f78ed0aba94c631bdeee9910f827948c58", "ja": "定期公演のソロ曲について相談したかったんだけど……\nなら、これは俺の方で決めておいた方がいいかな。", "zh": "本来想和你商量一下定期公演的独唱曲……  \n那还是由我来决定比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "e7340f17ca807e0ece21ed9b6efd49334372e97b98a0cc0c4a81202c63720e27", "ja": "だから待ちなさいってば！\n駄目に決まってるでしょ、そんなの！", "zh": "所以说，让你等一下嘛！\n那种事当然不行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "9dfe94713da6f873beebade136461d89c9b30bad358c5733d4617b0344ec92b8", "ja": "私のソロをどの曲にするかって話でしょ？\n新曲にするか、持ち歌にするか……。", "zh": "是在讨论我的独唱曲要选哪一首吧？选新歌，还是选自己的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "8718dbafac4aecdcc5a4c32d53c1a2e1b491054ee7c3a3b07e31ad868edc736b", "ja": "妥協して、中途半端にしたくないわ。スケジュールには\nまだ余裕があるんだし、もう少し待ちなさいよね！", "zh": "我可不想妥协，把事情弄得半吊子。日程安排\n明明还宽裕，你就再稍微等等啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e90938ec572032e24484e6ac304dc43ed62b58853371c904301e030418b46009", "ja": "そうか、わかった。\nもし決められなかったら、いつでも相談に乗るからな。", "zh": "这样啊，我明白了。\n要是你没法决定，随时都可以来找我商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "6d2bb954e0cbf6bfc9bd7fe7e68f5a3307412abc8664c5da351979e83cec41ea", "ja": "ええ、そうするわ。\nそれで……次は、ひなたの質問だったかしら？", "zh": "嗯，我会的。\n那么……接下来该回答的是日向的问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "cf9968def3e63ca835508572869d6fd95bba5b25b94ba42642f2792b6653aeef", "ja": "伊織お嬢さん、ごめんねぇ。\nあたしら何も知らんで、いっぱい質問してしまって。", "zh": "伊织小姐，对不起啊。\n我们什么都不知道，还问了你那么多问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "5b2ea0a0456a872a7e4068d2db3799e4fc89325d891a0bbecf53e4da0418c8f1", "ja": "別にいいわよ、気にしないで。\nイベントの準備も大切なお仕事なんだから。", "zh": "没什么，不用在意。\n准备活动也是很重要的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "86e33fb8e7a7be0b0bcfb09cff4664a91867d98b72faa0e2bd8be8c5dc4b2d1a", "ja": "ただ、そろそろ曲を決めなきゃなのも事実なのよね。\nなかなか納得いく答えが出ないんだけど……。", "zh": "不过，差不多也该决定曲目了，这也是事实。只是一直没能想出让自己满意的答案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "9946433c6ee7b34f19de6d694694684f5e6f4877da3e5b2abb75119c9b6d2f3e", "ja": "伊織、あまり根を詰めすぎてもよくありませんわ。\nいいアイディアも浮かばないでしょうし。", "zh": "伊织，太过埋头苦想也不好哦。\n这样也想不出什么好点子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ef24e8e4bc811b92e950713311c0618894c68a9cc8ca8cdba64184442def9220", "ja": "そうだな。せっかくのソロなんだ、\n伊織が納得いくまで考えてほしい。", "zh": "是啊，难得是独唱，就让伊织一直考虑到满意为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "e999c211f9fb1552b778f81017b5d98091517178338a61bf16b31a92c52880a3", "ja": "……そう？　なら、もう少し時間をもらうわね。", "zh": "……这样啊？那我就再多花点时间想想喽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "2be7c7e1c03b57bfff863d51274635233fbc4ac55f046dd9eab17b253f371758", "ja": "みにいべんとの準備に、定期公演の選曲……\n多忙な日が続きますね、伊織。", "zh": "迷你活动的准备、定期公演的选曲……\n忙碌的日子还要持续一阵子呢，伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1029_008tak", "source_sha256": "923c159c5fd9580d73cc515aff533c672596c0b2fc99f278c9aa15ab2f154480", "ja": "時間に余裕があるうちに、少々、\n息抜きなど試みてはいかがでしょうか？", "zh": "趁现在还有些空闲时间，稍微放松一下，您觉得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1030_007ior", "source_sha256": "abb6b9622d72a19056bcdebb410493addb2bcb6e870e39f51664193b974126f5", "ja": "気分転換ってこと？　そうね、ちょうど友達に\n誘われてるし……休みはゆっくりしようかしら。", "zh": "是说换换心情？嗯，正好朋友也约我……假期就悠闲地放松一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "06f51c171c328fb131994f18442922e328540a83fa3691dcfb6b34cf8e89d0c6", "ja": "へぇ、そうなんだ。友達って、学校の？", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。你说的朋友，是学校里的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "1ce47690176f274ef32edf2e9e2d58d0fb598934fc7627fc88d26231a68c8b82", "ja": "ううん、幼馴染よ。\n多分、会うのは5年ぶりくらいかしら？", "zh": "不是，是发小。\n大概有5年没见了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_110_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "abc971d01b8c0ddec504132cc0275cd298472a61dcb8521d8311eb5cf9552e93", "ja": "メイっていう子なんだけど……\n久しぶりに会えるの、楽しみだわ♪", "zh": "是一个叫梅的孩子……\n能和她久违地见面，我很期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
